Welcome to the Grand Meridian, and I hope the journey went smoothly. I'm your concierge. I can answer questions about the hotel, book tables, spa treatments and tours, and help you plan your days around Sorrento.

The pool and gym are open 06:00–22:00, and the spa is open 09:00–20:00. Check-out is at 11:00, and late check-out until 14:00 may be possible if a room is free. What can I help you with first?

